"""The site questionnaire form's words (10B-19, D-1249): ``python -m adapter.site_profile fill``.

The form is a command on the box, not a page (the lane lead's ruling: no route, no role change). Its refusals, its
answers template and its few lines of output are here, in en, ja and zh-TW, joined into the console's catalogue
(``console.i18n``) so that there is one catalogue of the product's words. ``profileform.err.<code>`` is one key per
refusal of :data:`adapter.site_questionnaire.CODES`; each names the answer (``{where}``) and says what is expected.
"""

